# dict_to_surface_node_inner via tmpl/i-string macro: verifies Literal, VarRef, Call
# variant reconstruction. The `tmpl` macro builds a [str ...] call AST from Literal
# and VarRef Variant nodes — all reconstructed via dict_to_surface_node_inner.
# This test exposes a macro-runtime-v2 regression (B-382).
# i"..." works in standalone expressions but fails inside letrec dicts with non-string values.
[x: 42  msg: i"Value is $x"]
=== out
Dict({"x": Int(42), "msg": String("Value is 42")})
